  "title": "Azure Hub-Spoke with AKS and Private PaaS",
  "description": "A hub-spoke cloud architecture in Azure. The hub provides centralized services like firewall, bastion, and on-premises connectivity. The spoke VNet hosts an Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) cluster and connects to PaaS services via private endpoints.",
