  "topology_summary": "This topology consists of a hub VNet and a spoke VNet peered together. The hub contains Azure Firewall, Bastion, and a VPN Gateway. The spoke contains an AKS cluster with multiple node pools and ingress controllers. PaaS services like Azure Key Vault, Container Registry, and Azure Monitor are accessed privately from the spoke via a dedicated private link subnet.",
